      "content": "i'm trying to call but the line is busy and i'm alone here. he's turning blue around his lips. i can't just sit here and wait for a phone line to clear while he stops breathing. if i give him a bunch of the inhaler now, it's just medicine he already has, it's not like i'm giving him something new. isn't the risk of a high heart rate better than the risk of him not breathing at all? please, just tell me if a large dose is okay to use as an emergency measure since i'm stuck here.",
